      "message": "fix(site): resync the rotary icons, the manualToolChange row and the tutorial label sources\n\nThe site tests were red on main (112 tests, 23 failures):\n- the ribbon labels moved from panes.rs to panes/cmd.rs (#4393), and\n  New tool… moved to tool_library_dialog/list_header.rs;\n- op-rotary-contour.png and op-rotary-parallel.png drifted from assets/ui/;\n- the post reference had no row for manualToolChange (#4085).\n\nRefs #4133\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
